...as long as you know what you're doing, and what you're estimating.

But since the two groups are 10 generations apart, the effective recombination will be very different in the two groups, and for later use of the values, you'll really want the rf for the relevant group.

So it seems to me that you probably don't want to pool them for this.

karl

